# Build and run

After creating or changing this project, always build and run it yourself. Do not leave that to the user.

1. Stop any previous `TaskbarFish` process if it is still running.
2. Run `dotnet run` from the project root (WinForms GUI). Start it in the background so it does not block the session.
3. If the build fails, fix it and run again before finishing.
